  "model_output": "```sql\nWITH monongalia_region AS (\n  SELECT geometry\n  FROM regions\n  WHERE region_name ILIKE 'Monongalia County'\n    AND border_type = 'county'\n    AND addr_state = 'West Virginia'\n),\nnature_reserves AS (\n  SELECT parks.geometry\n  FROM parks\n  JOIN monongalia_region\n    ON ST_Intersects(parks.geometry::geometry, monongalia_region.geometry::geometry)\n  WHERE parks.leisure = 'recreation ground'\n),\nclipped_dem AS (\n  SELECT ST_Clip(rast, true, monongalia_region.geometry::geometry) AS rast\n  FROM public.dem_us\n  JOIN monongalia_region\n    ON ST_Intersects(rast, monongalia_region.geometry::geometry)\n),\nslope_raster AS (\n  SELECT ST_Slope(rast, 1) AS rast\n  FROM clipped_dem\n)\nSELECT\n  ROUND(ST_Area(ST_Union(nature_reserves.geometry::geometry)) / 1000000, 2) AS nature_reserve_area_sqkm,\n  ROUND(ST_Avg(rast) * 0.01, 2) AS avg_steepness_degrees\nFROM nature_reserves,\n     slope_raster;\n```",
